From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Bastiaan van der Plaat <bastiaan.v.d.plaat@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Trim the menus for a handheld console

Options has Game Options, Setup Sound and Setup Video, without keyboard
and mouse setup or demo recording. Setup Video keeps Brightness and Show
FPS, Setup Sound loses the multiplayer opponent sound, and the parental
lock turns Adult Mode on and off without a password. The main menu has
Load Game and Options above Credits, and neither it nor the in-game menu
has Help or How To Order: their full screen pictures are scaled down to
the DS screen, where their text can't be read.
---
